     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Asha read that new kings collected taxes and kept armies.\n\"States had officers too,\" said her teacher."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
